{"id":15892,"artist":"A-Ha (KAR by: tomson)","title":"Crying In The Rain","lyrics_plain":null,"lyrics_synced":"[00:00.00] thanks a lot to: maser@starmedia.comKAR is better than ST3\n[00:02.73] exclusive by: tomson\n[00:10.91] tomson_br@mail.com\n[00:16.36] I'll never let you see\n[00:21.48] The way my broken heart is hurting me\n[00:26.93] I've got my pride and I know how to hide\n[00:31.36] All the sorrow and pain\n[00:35.11] I'll do my crying in the rain\n[00:43.47] If I wait for cloudy skies\n[00:48.75] You won't know the rain from the tears in my eyes\n[00:54.20] You'll never know that I still love you\n[00:57.61] So though the heartaches remain\n[01:02.39] I'll do my crying in the rain\n[01:10.91] Raindrops falling from heaven\n[01:15.34] Could never take away my misery\n[01:20.80] But since we're not together\n[01:23.52] I'll wait for stormy weather\n[01:26.25] To hide these tears I hope you'll never see\n[01:32.73] Someday when my crying's done\n[01:37.84] I'm gonna wear a smile and walk in the sun\n[01:43.30] I may be a fool\n[01:45.00] But till then, darling, you'll never see me complain\n[01:51.48] I'll do my crying in the rain\n[01:56.93] I'll do my crying in the rain\n[02:02.39] I'll do my crying in the rain\n[02:08.19] exclusive by: tomson\n[02:10.91] tomson_br@mail.com\n","lyrics_synced_enhanced":"[00:00.00] <00:00.00> thanks a lot to: maser\n[00:00.00] <00:00.00>  <00:00.00>  <00:02.73> exclusive <00:05.46> by: <00:08.18> tomson <00:10.91> tomson_br <00:16.36> I'll <00:17.04> ne <00:18.06> ver <00:18.40> let <00:18.74> you <00:19.43> see <00:21.47> The <00:21.81> way <00:22.15> my <00:22.49> bro <00:22.84> ken <00:23.18> heart <00:23.52> is <00:23.86> hur <00:24.20> ting <00:24.88> me <00:26.93> I've <00:27.27> got <00:27.61> my <00:27.95> pride <00:28.63> and <00:28.97> I <00:29.31> know <00:29.65> how <00:29.99> to <00:30.34> hide <00:31.36> All <00:31.70> the <00:32.04> sor <00:32.38> row <00:32.72> and <00:33.06> pain <00:35.11> I'll <00:35.45> do